[src/claude/subagent-detector.ts:185] make the prefilter cover the same tool names as the parsed check, ideally via the existing `isSubagentTool`/`SUBAGENT_TOOL_NAMES` source of truth — this keeps the fast path and avoids another Agent-vs-Task drift.

